# IX. Digital asset portfolios

This category is less glamorous but potentially very good for an autonomous lab.

## 26. Canva templates

Canva's Template Creator program pays royalties based on template usage. Canva explicitly encourages localized cultural/language templates and gives creators usage/export analytics. ([Canva][35])

This is almost perfect for:

```text
Oracle detects underserved template searches
        ↓
agent researches local/business use case
        ↓
creates template family
        ↓
quality verifier
        ↓
human/Canva approval
        ↓
usage data
        ↓
agent learns what sells
```

Templates become inventory.

No client work.

No deadline.

Infinite reuse.

