# 27. Webflow

Webflow now pays template creators **95% of each template sale**, retaining 5% for payment processing. Creators can also use fulfillment links to sell templates outside the Webflow Marketplace. ([Webflow][36])

The marketplace agreement also lists:

```text
templates    95%
libraries    80%
applications 100% initially,
             then 80% after year one
```

([Webflow][37])

This is more interesting than generic “freelance web design.”

An agent could maintain a portfolio of:

```text
dentist templates
trade-business templates
tiny hotels
local restaurants
SaaS launches
law firms
niche ecommerce
```

with actual conversion/sales data feeding back into the worker.

