# 28. Framer

Framer's August 7 documentation says creators can sell templates, plugins, components and vectors; **paid templates keep 100% of sales revenue**. Templates can also earn referral commissions. ([Framer][38])

Framer separately advertises up to 50% referral commissions. ([Framer][39])

However this one should be **downgraded by Oracle when community saturation rises**.

Headline economics:

```text
excellent
```

does not imply:

```text
expected marginal creator economics excellent
```

This is where Reddit/community supply-side pain becomes useful as a second layer over the official program data.

