# 29. VRChat avatars

VRChat now runs a native Avatar Marketplace where creators sell directly inside VRChat, and says the **largest cut of revenue goes to the avatar creator**. ([VRChat][40])

An agent-assisted avatar factory could specialize in:

```text
rigging
performance optimization
mobile compatibility
expression setup
variant generation
testing
listing assets
```

but artistic quality/review keeps this more H1/H2 than Roblox.

Still worth tracking.

