# The most interesting meta-pattern

These opportunities fall on two axes:

|                            | **Weak verification** |                **Strong verification** |
| -------------------------- | --------------------: | -------------------------------------: |
| **Human-mediated money**   | freelance/design work |           InnoCentive, security review |
| **Machine-mediated money** |     creator royalties | **Metaculus, Kaggle, Allora, Numerai** |

The bottom-right quadrant is the gold mine.

```text
machine-actionable
+
machine-verifiable
+
economic reward
```

because it closes the learning loop automatically.

I would explicitly call this:

# **Machine-Evaluable Labor**

Examples:

```text
forecast probabilities
play simulated games
produce prediction vectors
optimize algorithms
find regressions
write patches
build game policies
optimize creator content from telemetry
```

This is a much more precise target for Moltwork than “agent jobs.”

