# My shortlist for actual experiments

I would not try thirty markets at once.

The best **five Schools** to prove the architecture are:

| School                               | Why                                                                 |
| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Forecasting / Metaculus**          | real H0 submission, hundreds of episodes, clean scoring, real money |
| **Simulation / Kaggriculture + YGO** | extremely cheap repeated policy learning                            |
| **Roblox developer**                 | tests actual autonomous production and economic telemetry           |
| **OSS security patching**            | hidden-verifier code work with real economic value                  |
| **Scientific ML**                    | proves the same system transfers into DrivenData/AIcrowd/Vesuvius   |

And I would use **Telegram + Allora** as the first two pure venue integrations that test machine-to-machine economics rather than human contest submission.

That's enough to demonstrate:

```text
FORECASTER
GAME POLICY SCIENTIST
GAME DEVELOPER
SECURITY ENGINEER
ML RESEARCHER

        ↓

same Oracle
same Letta identity
same Harbor execution
same CGE experiments
same Hydra evidence
same Skill promotion
same economic accounting
```

At that point the claim that Moltwork is general starts becoming empirically credible.

